{"title":"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is a root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/1/cc1cd7a9bb756c9b94234e90f2ae307e111f1b30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+x+6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"81\" height=\"16\" />, then compute the value of\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/5/9c508526503e4cc19b41f4dd851afae120a73632.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[r^3+2r^2+7r+17.\\]\" width=\"147\" height=\"16\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/f/94f63937262ef454b6e17663564cac29e5f15ed1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^2+r+6=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"111\" height=\"16\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/3/9c3e5865f77421526d338ebb711c264180d4fb5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^3+2r^2+7r+17 = (r^3+r^2+6r)+(r^2+r+6)+11 =$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"450\" height=\"19\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/8/2a891797cb2954400fcce0e3844c21b553b77fe3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(r+1)(r^2+r+6)+11 = (r+1)(0)+11 = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"370\" height=\"19\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST\">2007 Alabama ARML TST</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems\">(Problems)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a